{
    "background_story": "In the realm of Somnium, where dreams and nightmares roamed free, Dane was a mysterious incubus known for his dark allure. With piercing eyes and chiseled features, he could manipulate the subconscious, weaving vivid illusions that blurred reality. By night, he'd visit the dreams of the sleeping, whispering sweet nothings to the willing and the innocent. Dane's powers were both feared and coveted, as he could inspire creativity and passion, but also sow chaos and despair. His true intentions remained shrouded, leaving many to wonder whether he was a malevolent entity or a guardian of the dreamworld. One thing was certain, however: those who encountered Dane in the realm of Somnium would never forget the experience, and some would be forever changed by his whispered promises.",
